1
00:00:00.411 --> 00:00:03.128
Unit nine. Healthy Sleep Habits!

2
00:00:04.115 --> 00:00:07.771
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.821 --> 00:00:10.866
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.916 --> 00:00:14.683
Today we learn about Healthy Sleep Habits. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.873 --> 00:00:19.507
Sleep hygiene. Say it with me. Sleep hygiene!

6
00:00:23.064 --> 00:00:26.398
Routine. Say it with me. Routine!

7
00:00:29.892 --> 00:00:33.176
Dark room. Say it with me. Dark room!

8
00:00:36.637 --> 00:00:39.954
Caffeine. Say it with me. Caffeine!

9
00:00:43.486 --> 00:00:47.020
Screens. Say it with me. Screens!

10
00:00:50.503 --> 00:00:54.103
Naps. Say it with me. Naps!

11
00:00:57.655 --> 00:01:00.955
Weekend. Say it with me. Weekend!

12
00:01:04.441 --> 00:01:07.625
Energy. Say it with me. Energy!

13
00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:21.041
Sleep hygiene means habits that help sleep: a regular routine and a dark room. Avoid caffeine and screens before bed and long naps. Keeping a similar time on the weekend helps energy.

14
00:01:21.091 --> 00:01:23.897
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:25.532 --> 00:01:30.520
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:31.720
Dark room!

17
00:01:32.531 --> 00:01:37.411
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.461 --> 00:01:38.611
Weekend!

19
00:01:39.376 --> 00:01:45.177
Did you know? Sleeping in very late at weekends can make it harder to wake up on Monday!

20
00:01:45.227 --> 00:01:46.950
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.646 --> 00:01:55.202
Think and answer. Which sleep hygiene habit could you improve?

22
